  "description": "Sets up a sample field service business: a field team of three technicians and a dispatcher with a day shift template, two service territories, boiler and van asset types with a training boiler and a van that carries stock, a boiler safety checklist, a standard service level, a waiting-on-parts sub-status, and boiler service and no-heat work order types. Publish a schedule for the Field Operations team, then add work orders and dispatch them from the board.",
  "author": "CrestApps",
  "website": "https://crestapps.com",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "issetuprecipe": false,
  "categories": [
    "field service"
